    {
      "beat_id": "B07",
      "act": "WHAT TO DO",
      "narration_text": "So for your Lyrical Literacy videos: a recording playing under your voice can still be matched, even under loud talking. Upload checks like YouTube's Content ID compare your audio with files that copyright owners submit. And not being matched isn't the same as being allowed. Use music you made, or music you're licensed to use.",
